{"parse": {"title": "再会在新世界-07", "pageid": 142063, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%8D%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C-06\" title=\"再会在新世界-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">再会在新世界-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%8D%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C-08\" title=\"再会在新世界-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">再会在新世界</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.AF.B7.E4.B8.8D.E8.A6.81.E5.AF.B9.E6.88.91.E5.86.B7.E9.85.B7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"请不要对我冷酷\">请不要对我冷酷</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 请不要对我冷酷</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Do Not Be Cruel to Me</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我有一个好消息和三个或更多的坏消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我想先听好消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>首先恭喜你活下来了，而且没让任何人在生死关头像等你拖稿一样在原地等死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你好像觉得我是那种会拖着全车的人等我深情告别的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>那么剩下的就全是坏消息了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝图长叹了一口气，甩了甩手中的设计稿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我相信这是一份足以在建筑史上留名的设计，我是说——假如那些写书的人能知道“暴雨”是什么的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我很少说这种话，不过你提交的方案确实值得这一个月的等待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……然而“暴雨”纪念碑项目本身已经被取消了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我不惊讶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>这一次的“暴雨”也让基金会损失惨重，我们已经没有资源再投入这个项目了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>一些不怀好意的极端纯血主义神秘学家们宣称，“暴雨”的周期只会越来越短。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这对建筑业来说可真不算是个好消息……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>嗯哼，以及巴塞罗那当地的调查员帮你看过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>那栋……你的建筑朋友没有留下任何痕迹。那儿现在只是片荒地了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>拉普拉斯那边针对传送术式的应用取得了重大突破，因此高层认为没有必要再继续罗塞拉女士的项目了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>也就是说……不会再有这种预制板结构的办事处被建成了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>当基金会应对“暴雨”的手段越来越成熟后，我想这个小小的、失败的计划也不会再被任何人提起了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>和所有不切实际的失败者们一样，被扫进无人问津的废纸堆里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>同样并不令我感到意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奠基石抿了一口咖啡，这是她在外漂泊数月后第一次喝到令人满意的调配饮品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我的外出许可批下来了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……我说过，已经没有好消息了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>以及你到底把我当什么了？你在基金会的后门吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>怎么会呢，你还是我唯一能研究德国人幽默感的珍贵对象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>可惜你好像没有因为“暴雨”笑话笑出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你知道吗……我总觉得你们脑子里像是缺根弦，但当我想要因此而攻击神秘学家的时候，我就会可悲地发现我也是你们之中的一员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝图摇了摇头，把早就攥在手里的文件扔给了奠基石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>巴塞罗那已经没有你要找的东西了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>无论是你的建筑朋友还是令你魂牵梦萦的巴塞罗那椅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>即便如此，我还是会去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你早就知道我是这样的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我就知道……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第二次叹息传来，随着建筑师的离开，房间里再一次只剩下她孤零零一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-650217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-650217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-650217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>一切都会回到正轨……吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_09.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_09\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_09\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Cg-3_7_bg_09.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Cg-3_7_bg_09.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Cg-3_7_bg_09.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我听说了人们在这次“暴雨”中罹难的样子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>手臂变成一节一节的圆环，头颅滚落在地，成为比地球还标准的正球体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你会成为什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>一个三角形，一个长方形，上面画着一个“田”？或许还有一根小小的烟囱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>就像每个孩子都曾画过的儿童画一般。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……人们通常用它去指代“家”。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin\"><img alt=\"senlin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/600px-Cg-senlin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/900px-Cg-senlin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/1200px-Cg-senlin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奠基石漫步在杂草丛生的林地间，剧变的环境使得她只能根据基金会提供的坐标来确认朋友曾经坐落的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这儿确实不是个建房子的好地方，真不敢想那些吊车开进来的时候遭了多少罪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>空气湿润，鸟儿欢唱，连蜘蛛和壁虎都很有活力。这儿确实是一处好地方。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_29.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_29\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_29\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Cg-3_8_at_29.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Cg-3_8_at_29.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_29.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Cg-3_8_at_29.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_29.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奠基石通常会穿着一身定制的西装去和自己的客户们会面。在社交场上，昂贵的外表通常是流通的硬货。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但这些对建筑师来说本无意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——于是她就那么躺在了草地上，任由泥土弄脏她身上一切价格不菲的织物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后，想象着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>想象着某种坚硬的地基突破表皮，像根系一样牢牢攥紧了土壤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>想象着自己的躯体逐渐膨大，双手成为视觉的延伸，眺望那些和自己一样庞大的巨物们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机场不再是设施，而是邻卧在自己身边的另一种生物，她们的界限被一群自称为建筑师的人们严格划下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>想象自己——成为一栋建筑。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuekeshi\"><img alt=\"daxuekeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/600px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/900px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>老师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>您完成自己的设计了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>完成了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>但它或许不会被建造出来，您不觉得遗憾吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不，因为理念和设计是不会死去的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不如说，你应该恭喜老师找到了更多想做的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>是的，我想要……守护你们的想法、你们的梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>就算这些设计再糟糕，我也想让它抵达尽可能远的过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>那些不切实际的，轻佻的，业余的……粗俗的美学。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我会把它们种植在我的躯体里，我会越过每一场“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>回声谣悼念逝去的旧的思念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>而我铭记你们，本应在新千年开花结果的新奇理念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>无论我们会回到哪里……无论过去的历史多么厚重，多么具有价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>恭喜你，老师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-653810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-653810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-653810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>恭喜你……斯塔夏……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“学生”的面孔逐渐变得模糊，在梦境随雨水一同漫上海平面前，奠基石终于看清了梦中的来人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……罗莎？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我只是一段“回声”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>当“光”浸润你的意识时，我便偷偷待在了你的心脏里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我是杜法赦，我是罗莎，我也是回声谣的一部分……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我是所有你爱着的、思念着的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>再见了，斯塔夏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你选择的道路，非常美丽……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>再见……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>教室随着回声的渐弱开始在虚影中远去，连带着那些面孔一同在记忆中重新变得模糊。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "再会在新世界-07"}}